{"id":"math-1-09","number":9,"title":"অন্তরীকরণ","existing_questions":8,"original_questions":92,"question_format_note":"মৌলিক প্রশ্নে সূত্রভিত্তিক সংখ্যাগত অনুশীলন রয়েছে; একই ধারণার ভিন্ন সংখ্যাগত সমস্যা থাকতে পারে।","available_questions":100,"target_questions":100,"questions":[{"id":"10c4b7b6e9965c8e","question_bn":"যদি $y = e^{\\sin x}$ হয়, তবে $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ কত?","options":["$\\cos x \\cdot e^{\\sin x}$","$-\\cos x \\cdot e^{\\sin x}$","$\\sin x \\cdot e^{\\sin x}$","$e^{\\cos x}$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"চেইন রুল অনুসারে: $\\frac{dy}{dx} = e^{\\sin x} \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(\\sin x) = \\cos x \\cdot e^{\\sin x}$।","book_reference":"এস ইউ আহাম্মদ ও এম এ জব্বার (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"5621e687524866a0","question_bn":"$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos 4x}{x^2}$-এর মান কত?","options":["$8$","$4$","$16$","$4/2$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"ল' হসপিটাল রুল প্রয়োগ করে: $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{4\\sin 4x}{2x} = \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{4^2\\cos 4x}{2} = \\frac{4^2}{2} = 8$।","book_reference":"এস ইউ আহাম্মদ ও এম এ জব্বার (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"80e696366d52a3fa","question_bn":"$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos 5x}{x^2}$-এর মান কত?","options":["$25/2$","$5$","$25$","$5/2$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"ল' হসপিটাল রুল প্রয়োগ করে: $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{5\\sin 5x}{2x} = \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{5^2\\cos 5x}{2} = \\frac{5^2}{2} = 25/2$।","book_reference":"এস ইউ আহাম্মদ ও এম এ জব্বার (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"8da01b9bbe0c13c9","question_bn":"$f(x) = x + \\frac{1}{x}$ ফাংশনটির লঘিষ্ঠ (Minimum) মান কত ($x > 0$)?","options":["$2$","$-2$","$0$","$1$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"$f'(x) = 1 - \\frac{1}{x^2} = 0 \\Rightarrow x = 1$ ($x>0$)। $f''(1) > 0$, তাই লঘিষ্ঠ মান $f(1) = 1 + 1 = 2$।","book_reference":"এস ইউ আহাম্মদ ও এম এ জব্বার (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"abbd25d4bbcd6512","question_bn":"$\\frac{d}{dx}(\\ln|\\sec x + \\tan x|)$-এর মান কোনটি?","options":["$\\sec x$","$\\tan x$","$\\sec^2 x$","$\\sec x \\tan x$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"$\\frac{d}{dx}(\\ln|\\sec x + \\tan x|) = \\frac{\\sec x\\tan x + \\sec^2 x}{\\sec x + \\tan x} = \\sec x$।","book_reference":"প্রফেসর কেতাব উদ্দিন (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"b58019cadb9f34b1","question_bn":"$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos 3x}{x^2}$-এর মান কত?","options":["$9/2$","$3$","$9$","$3/2$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"ল' হসপিটাল রুল প্রয়োগ করে: $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{3\\sin 3x}{2x} = \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{3^2\\cos 3x}{2} = \\frac{3^2}{2} = 9/2$।","book_reference":"এস ইউ আহাম্মদ ও এম এ জব্বার (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"e9e434c713fd3101","question_bn":"$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos 2x}{x^2}$-এর মান কত?","options":["$2$","$2$","$4$","$2/2$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"ল' হসপিটাল রুল প্রয়োগ করে: $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2\\sin 2x}{2x} = \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2^2\\cos 2x}{2} = \\frac{2^2}{2} = 2$।","book_reference":"এস ইউ আহাম্মদ ও এম এ জব্বার (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"fcbfef97a1354ede","question_bn":"$y = x^2 - 4x + 3$ পরাবৃত্তের $(2, -1)$ বিন্দুতে স্পর্শকের ঢাল কত?","options":["$0$","$2$","$-4$","$1$"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"ঢাল $\\frac{dy}{dx} = 2x - 4$। $(2, -1)$ বিন্দুতে ঢাল $= 2(2) - 4 = 0$।","book_reference":"অসীম কুমার সাহা (১ম পত্র)","source_files":["math_100_tests.json","versity_100_tests.json"]},{"id":"7467c6a69586e054","question_bn":"y=x^2 হলে x=1-এ dy/dx কত?","options":["2","3","4","1"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"d(x^n)/dx=nx^(n−1)। তাই উত্তর 2।","book_reference":"অধ্যায়ভিত্তিক মৌলিক অনুশীলনী · বইয়ের সরাসরি উদ্ধৃতি নয়","source_files":["original_practice.py","content/original_facts.txt"],"origin":"original_practice","